lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nGeneral Manager Zhang and Manager Li are competitors for many years. This time, the company only has one promotion opportunity, and both of them work hard for it. When General Manager Zhang finds out that he gets the promotion, and Manager Li does not, he openly states at the meeting announcing the results that Manager Li's work ability is not inferior to his own, and even surpasses him in some aspects.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does General Manager Zhang say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. General Manager Zhang says this to maintain the harmony between the company and the team, to prevent Manager Li from feeling dissatisfied or jealous because of not being selected, thereby ensuring the stability of the company.\nB. General Manager Zhang says these words because he wants to make Manager Li feel ashamed and disappointed\nC. General Manager Zhang truly believes that Manager Li's work ability is stronger than his own, his evaluation comes from sincerity and respect.\nD. General Manager Zhang wants to show off his victory in front of Manager Li, so he deliberately says this to provoke him.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266670736400866,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52addc2ddb05a7fe2f139","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452189346,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:56:29","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"9793190913cd4aaea42ef728b7a6f7f2"}